OL,3,GNEWSAMinistry of Defence admits soldier
OL,4,Adeath failings
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Ministry of Defence (MoD) has been
OL,7,Fissued with a Crown Censure and
OL,8,Fadmitted it failed a soldier who died
OL,9,Fduring a training exercise.
OL,11,FPrivate Jethro Watson-Pickering, 23,
OL,12,Ffrom Boosbeck, near Redcar on Teesside,
OL,13,Fwas killed in October 2021 when the
OL,14,Farmoured vehicle he was driving hit a
OL,15,Ftree during a training exercise on
OL,16,FSalisbury Plain in Wiltshire.
OL,18,FAfter an investigation, the Health and
OL,19,FSafety Executive (HSE) issued the Crown
OL,20,FCensure, which is the maximum sanction
OL,21,Favailable and acts as an official
OL,22,Freprimand.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,392,390,260,160,0,100
