OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMinistry of Defence admits soldier
OL,4,Adeath failings
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccepting the censure on behalf of the
OL,7,FBritish Army, General Sir Roly Walker
OL,8,Fapologised and said: "Jethro should
OL,9,Fnever have died. We failed him and
OL,10,Fthose who loved him."
